  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #000080;\">Essay writing competition in commemoration of India's 79th Independence Day</span></h3>\nIn commemoration of India's 79th Independence Day, ATMECE is organised an Essay writing competition, on August 13, 2025, at 11:00 AMin the Civil Block, both jn English &amp; Kannada languages.\n<strong>Topic;</strong> *\"Impact of the Emergency declared in India in 1975\n<strong>Rules:</strong> *Essay should not exceed 500 words or 2 pages.- Time: 30 minutes.\n\n[caption id=\"attachment_21316\" align=\"aligncenter\" width=\"76\"]<a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Independence-ESSAY-25.pdf\" data-wp-editing=\"1\"><img class=\"wp-image-21316\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/—Pngtree—download-icon_3581467.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a> <span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">DOWNLOAD&nbsp; REPORT</span>[/caption]",
